			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 700960601,
					"content": "很好…按照芭比洛斯的预言，那个需要指引的人类再过一会就会来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960602,
					"content": "登场台词…记住了。出场效果…确认过了。嗯，这次绝对万无一失！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960603,
					"content": "你们说…最后一则预言，为什么要洛恩来这儿啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960604,
					"content": "现在就来了？难道杜林没念完他的台词？不好…要小声…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960605,
					"content": "难道最后一次「直面龙威」…说的是特瓦林？不过它今天是不是不在呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960606,
					"content": "严格来说，我之前已经见过「东风守护」了。在我刚从挪德卡莱返回的时候，就在你们旁边。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960607,
					"content": "对哦，是在奔狼领替法尔伽送信的那次吧！这样算起来，你的「预言」其实已经结束了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960608,
					"content": "至少「三次直面龙威」，满打满算的话大概可以结束了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960609,
					"content": "还剩下「理解强大的意义」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960610
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700960610,
					"content": "嗯，估计这才是「预言」指引我来这的理由吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960611,
					"content": "这个地方在被称作「风龙废墟」之前，曾是龙卷之魔神的领域。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960612,
					"content": "能卷起飓风庇护一切的强大魔神，却拦不住风墙之内对于自由的向往。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960613,
					"content": "曾与它角逐神座的北风之魔神，却在放弃力量之后，找到了一直追寻的答案。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960614,
					"content": "咦？这孩子…好像也没有法尔伽说的那么偏执？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960615,
					"content": "「明晨之镜」、「魔龙杜林」…也都曾陷入过不解与迷茫，而令他们走向强大的，却从不只是力量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960616,
					"content": "嗯嗯…悟性不错呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960617,
					"content": "还有曾经的天使——「乌萨」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960618,
					"content": "…嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960619,
					"content": "虽然话说得很有道理…但这真是洛恩你会说出来的台词吗！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960620,
						700960621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960620,
					"content": "先是杜林…又是洛恩…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960622
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700960622,
					"content": "「选择了力量的天使，依旧渴望靠近人类，竟至堕落为了可悲的魔物…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960623,
					"content": "「见证过这一切的人类啊，依旧执着于力量吗？」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960624,
					"content": "——这全是我的词啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960625,
					"content": "呜哇！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960626,
					"content": "啊…一不小心就…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960627,
					"content": "幸会，尼可女士。您写的剧本，我已经拜读过了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960628,
					"content": "唉…是从杜林那里捡到的吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960629,
					"content": "哦？难不成这也是预言？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960630,
					"content": "只是我的猜测而已。要是这也能预言到，我刚才也不会…咳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960631,
					"content": "总之，这剧本写得不错，当成童话来读读还挺解闷的。不过我不太喜欢被人说教…就算是「天使」也不行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960632
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960632,
					"content": "…我就当你是在说我那位选择力量的前同事了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960633
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960633,
					"content": "既然你捡到了剧本，那我想要说的话，你应该也全看到了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960634
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960634,
					"content": "嗯，我会把这些台词，都当成宝贵的建议记下来。如果没什么事，我就回去继续编我的强敌图鉴了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960635,
						700960636
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960635,
					"content": "（没说会听从这建议呢…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960637
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700960637,
					"content": "不过我今天确实也收获了不少，嗯…大概是有变强了那么一点吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960638
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960638,
					"content": "谢谢咯，各位…也代我向「幕后人员」们都问声好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960639
					],
					"speakerTitle": "洛恩"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960639,
					"content": "唉…果然又是一个难对付的人类。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960640
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960640,
					"content": "所以，这到底是什么情况啊？谁来帮我理一理…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960641
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960641,
					"content": "你们之前不是解决了多托雷，还有乌萨留在蒙德的「遗毒」吗？听说洛恩在那时候，也遭了不少罪？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960642
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960642,
					"content": "既然是从前的「天使」留下的祸患，那当然得靠现在的「天使」来导正…虽然跟我一开始预想的是有一点偏离…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960643
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960643,
					"content": "以后人类的命运，恐怕会变得更加不可预测吧？天使对人类的引导，也不再是通往未来的唯一解。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960644
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960644,
					"content": "但这些无限的可能性…也许正是人类的「强大」之处呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 700960636,
					"content": "（还是要继续编图鉴啊…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960637
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700960621,
					"content": "怎么都开始念剧本了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700960622
					]
				}
			]
		},
